            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<strong>Symploké: The Legend of Gustavo Bueno</strong> is a point and click adventure with the scent of legendary classics such as The Secret of Monkey Island or The Day of the Tentacle. The game is completely designed in MS Paint and it is divided in different chapters. This is Chapter 2.<br><br><u><strong>Did You Finish Chapter 1?</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/678920/extras/aef13e2d786b7e29094e5f46eaae558b.avif?t=1783461179\" width=600 height=554 /></span><br><br>To play Chapter 2 you must introduce the password given when you got through Chapter 1. If you haven’t, please download Chapter 1 for free and come back once you have completed it.<br><br><u><strong>Dismantling Corruption</strong></u><br><br>If you thought that your University was an example of freedom and independent thought, you were wrong! Discover what is happening behind the scenes and save students from an untrustworthy Rector Magnificus.<br><br><u><strong>Homage to Hegel</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/678920/extras/97d45d917dd10597b90f4600913fd9d5.avif?t=1783461179\" width=530 height=160 /></span><br><br>The structure of each chapter of this game is set as in Hegel’s The Phenomenology of Spirit: every chapter is a step forward towards the path of the Spirit. This is Hegel’s main contribution to the world of gaming.",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>Symploké: The Legend of Gustavo Bueno</strong> is a point and click adventure with the scent of legendary classics such as The Secret of Monkey Island or The Day of the Tentacle. The game is completely designed in MS Paint and it is divided in different chapters. This is Chapter 2.<br><br><u><strong>Did You Finish Chapter 1?</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/678920/extras/aef13e2d786b7e29094e5f46eaae558b.avif?t=1783461179\" width=600 height=554 /></span><br><br>To play Chapter 2 you must introduce the password given when you got through Chapter 1. If you haven’t, please download Chapter 1 for free and come back once you have completed it.<br><br><u><strong>Dismantling Corruption</strong></u><br><br>If you thought that your University was an example of freedom and independent thought, you were wrong! Discover what is happening behind the scenes and save students from an untrustworthy Rector Magnificus.<br><br><u><strong>Homage to Hegel</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/678920/extras/97d45d917dd10597b90f4600913fd9d5.avif?t=1783461179\" width=530 height=160 /></span><br><br>The structure of each chapter of this game is set as in Hegel’s The Phenomenology of Spirit: every chapter is a step forward towards the path of the Spirit. This is Hegel’s main contribution to the world of gaming.",
